  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Line a baking sheet with parchment paper.",
    "Season the chicken drumsticks with salt, pepper, and garlic powder.",
    "Dredge the chicken in flour, then coat with breadcrumbs, pressing gently to adhere.",
    "Place the coated chicken on the prepared baking sheet and dot with butter.",
    "Bake for 20 minutes or until the chicken is cooked through and golden brown.",
    "In a saucepan over medium heat, melt the tempering chocolate and stir in heavy cream until smooth.",
    "Stir in grated cheddar cheese until melted and smooth, then season with salt and pepper.",
    "Toss the cooked chicken in the chocolate sauce until well coated.",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley and serve on a Talavera plate.",
    "Let the chicken rest for 5 minutes before serving."
  ],
